This product is a clean-room implementation of the method described in
"Jackknife: A Reliable Recognizer with Few Samples and Many Modalities"
(Taranta et al., CHI 2017, https://doi.org/10.1145/3025453.3026002).
It contains no code from the authors' reference implementation and does not
implement synthetic gesture generation (gesture path stochastic resampling).
